  "description": "\"Mio, what's your dream?\"\n\"My mom told me to get into a good university and get a good job.\"\n\"Not your mom's dream, Mio. What do you want?\"\n\nMio Oh, is an ordinary third-year high schooler who up until now, tried her very best to fulfil her mom's dream in her place. Instead of chasing the ideal societal norm, Mio takes a leap of courage to pursue the dream she has had since she was little, the \"drawings\" she had to hide from her mother.\n\nIn her pursuit, Mio goes to join an art academy but... This school seems a bit strange?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
